      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1246533038,
      "version": 442,
      "versionNonce": 1672249522,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779887916689,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There's a firewall, but it's\njust for show—it doesn't\ndo anything useful. ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "11jI392-c5SMOcb4CV6_L",
      "originalText": "There's a firewall, but it's just for show—it doesn't do anything useful. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XfaYn0SqX-aQ-ZRNfSehY",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 5360.852519665995,
      "y": 118.69023977775646,
      "width": 983.8221028967587,
      "height": 721.7760287607061,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1824284274,
      "version": 482,
      "versionNonce": 1933039026,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "SiZyIIX42s6zDDuKzlDIK"
        },
        {
          "id": "9fR63QcBOGcciFAmwCdnn",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1779887913189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "SiZyIIX42s6zDDuKzlDIK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5370.521902413202,
      "y": 164.57825415810953,
      "width": 964.4833374023438,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 31974514,
      "version": 415,
      "versionNonce": 1490440050,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779887913189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The C server has the following vulnerabilities\n- The binary does not have the canary or pie protection\nflags\n- The binary has a buffer overflow when validating the\naccess token; if a token that is too long is sent, the service\ncrashes and causes a segmentation fault\n- Due to a typo in the function related to the\n/api/firmware/latest endpoint, a memory leak occurs\n(missed %p format instead of %s)\n- The user has control over the content stored at the leaked\nmemory address\n- A ret2win attack can be performed to reach the `system`\nfunction and execute commands (in our case, sending a\nrequest and gaining command execution on the server)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "XfaYn0SqX-aQ-ZRNfSehY",
      "originalText": "The C server has the following vulnerabilities\n- The binary does not have the canary or pie protection flags\n- The binary has a buffer overflow when validating the access token; if a token that is too long is sent, the service crashes and causes a segmentation fault\n- Due to a typo in the function related to the /api/firmware/latest endpoint, a memory leak occurs (missed %p format instead of %s)\n- The user has control over the content stored at the leaked memory address\n- A ret2win attack can be performed to reach the `system` function and execute commands (in our case, sending a request and gaining command execution on the server)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
