      "updated": 1779889028535,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It is used to map all hosts on the network\nto a domain name\nand is vulnerable to a zone transfer attack\n(AXFR), which allows an attacker to map\nall hosts registered in the DNS ",
      "fontSize": 51.98568554521635,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It is used to map all hosts on the network to a domain name\nand is vulnerable to a zone transfer attack (AXFR), which allows an attacker to map all hosts registered in the DNS ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
