    {
      "id": "jnsfA0tPQiON9AWw7-Ags",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15738.270149867687,
      "y": -5695.144508376699,
      "width": 2016.0051575377781,
      "height": 925.7142857142867,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1119944430,
      "version": 89,
      "versionNonce": 2130087534,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779987591252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "General vulnerabilities\n- All services use weak credentials\n- The network is not segmented; all hosts can communicate\nwith each other\n- The subnet for the diagnostic server has full access to the\ninternal network\n- No services use HTTPS\n- The user SuperTech:SuperPassword has sudo privileges\non all hosts on the network\n- Reused credentials ",
      "fontSize": 74.05714285714292,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "General vulnerabilities\n- All services use weak credentials\n- The network is not segmented; all hosts can communicate with each other\n- The subnet for the diagnostic server has full access to the internal network\n- No services use HTTPS\n- The user SuperTech:SuperPassword has sudo privileges on all hosts on the network\n- Reused credentials ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bwd2YNZCAThKPBLmqo_rb",
